e="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5366" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5366"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasw6orgq/"></a>(ШҲВ)</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5367/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5367" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5367"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasgr32m9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="8" rowspan="6" style="width: 14.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5368/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5368" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5368"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfas2ngd19/"></a>Ходимлар учун меҳнат ва дам олишнинг энг қулай тартибини таъминлаш</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 1.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5369/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5369" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5369"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasxiueal/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight" style="width: 1.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5370/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5370" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5370"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfaswkevhg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="8" rowspan="6" style="width: 17.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5371/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5371" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5371"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfas2l2a7g/"></a>Ходимларга даволаш &#8212; соғломлаштириш хизмати кўрсатилишини таъминлаш</p></td><td class="bdRi