/document/90/17690/bssPhr5502/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5502" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5502"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasg6n0s9/"></a>Меҳнатни муҳофаза қилиш бўйича аниқланган номувофиқликлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 18%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5503/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5503" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5503"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfas0q62g1/"></a>Камчилик ва номувофиқликларни бартараф этиш бўйича чора-тадбирлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 10%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5504/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5504" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5504"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfascii0fu/"></a>Ижроси учун жавобгар шахслар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5505/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5505" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5505"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasrtk23k/"></a>Бажариш муддати</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 19%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5506/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5506" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5506"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfascpqxw8/"></a>Бажарилгани бўйича белги</p><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasalw27u/"></a>(сана, бажаришга жавобгар шахс ва меҳнатни муҳофаза қилиш бўйича вакил имзоси)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 9%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfashpc0op/"></a><strong>1</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5509/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5509" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5509"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasufk8ec/"></a><strong>2</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 16%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5510/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5510" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5510"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfastb3uye/"></a><strong>3</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 18%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5511/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5511" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5511"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasqmfwwn/"></a><strong>4</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 10%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5512/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5512" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5512"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfastdnguy/"></a><strong>5</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" st