ent/90/17690/bssPhr5577/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5577" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5577"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasukenx8/"></a>Меҳнатни муҳофаза қилиш</p><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasxodxs4/"></a>бўйича аниқланган номувофиқликлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 19%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfas4dck0m/"></a>Номувофиқликларни бартараф этиш бўйича</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasenorif/"></a>чора-тадбирлар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasuongng/"></a>Ижроси учун жавобгар шахслар</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr5582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfask00l1p/"></a>Бажариш муддати</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 21%;