"toc" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/tit52/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6896/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6896" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6896"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasux9gaw/"></a>Меҳнатни муҳофаза қилиш бўйича йўл-йўриқдан ўтказиш, ўқитиш ва билимларни текшириш, малака ошириш ҳамда қайта тайёрлаш тўғрисидаги низомга&#160;5-ИЛОВА</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6897/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6897" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6897"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasawnhz0/"></a><strong>______________________________ бўйича</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6898/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6898" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6898"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfaseozwe3/"></a><strong><sup>(бўлинманинг номи)</sup></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6899/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6899" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6899"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasd0l8o8/"></a><strong>стажировкани ўтказиш вазифасини юклаш тўғрисида</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6900/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6900" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6900"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasqh3a5i/"></a><strong>ВАРАҚАСИ</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6901/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6901" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6901"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasy4gtlg/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6902/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6902" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6902"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasxyfarg/"></a>20___ йил &#171;____&#187; ___________ ___________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6903/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6903" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6903"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfasf784mq/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6904/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6904" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6904"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/dfascszlfa/"></a>Ишларни хавфсиз бажаришнинг амалий кўникмаларини эгаллаш мақсадида ________________________________________________________________________ га қабул қилинган.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width: 112.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/17690/bssPhr6905/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="6905" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr6905"></a><a data-anchor="